{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 135, "line_no": 5, "text": "（7）五位功曹，男性，五人骑着五匹神马，据说专负责联络各类鬼神。", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 455, "w": 1182, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（7）五位功曹，男性，五人骑着五匹神马，据说专负责联络各类鬼神。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 455, "w": 1182, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 135, "line_no": 6, "text": "（8）李应社王，男性，面目开朗，神态大方，系坛上神人之间礼仪、物品交接证明人。", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 519, "w": 1427, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "（8）李应社王，男性，面目开朗，神态大方，系坛上神人之间礼仪、物品交接证明人。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 519, "w": 1427, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 135, "line_no": 7, "text": "（9）欧官，男性，申请做“祧”需经他应允。", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 587, "w": 712, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（9）欧官，男性，申请做“祧”需经他应允。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 587, "w": 712, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 135, "line_no": 8, "text": "（10）她地许，女性，面目慈善，专管理坛上杂事。", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 656, "w": 828, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（10）她地许，女性，面目慈善，专管理坛上杂事。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 656, "w": 828, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 135, "line_no": 9, "text": "（11）蒙官，男性，浓眉大眼，满嘴胡须，宣布坛上法规，监督、检查、维护秩序。", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 712, "w": 1319, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（11）蒙官，男性，浓眉大眼，满嘴胡须，宣布坛上法规，监督、检查、维护秩序。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 712, "w": 1319, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
